One file per arm, sourced by docker/flavour-setup.sh inside the image.

  RCC_DEBIAN_TAG    Debian suite the arm was written for
  RCC_ARCH          restrict to one architecture, empty = any
  RCC_SYSDEPS       apt packages
  RCC_SYSDEB_URLS   .deb files fetched by URL (for packages no longer in the suite)
  RCC_APT_PIN       apt preferences content, applied before RCC_SYSDEB_URLS
  RCC_APT_HOLD      packages to apt-mark hold after install
  RCC_APT_REMOVE    packages to remove before RCC_SYSDEB_URLS, if installed
  RCC_RCONF_FLAGS   flags passed through build-R to Rconf
  RCC_LDFLAGS       appended to the configure line
  RCC_DESC          one-line description, written to /etc/rcheck/flavour.txt
